Hi All,

I am trying to host one of my shiny apps in a Linux server. The current Linux version of R is 3.2.3 and it is giving me an error message:
ERROR: there is no package called ‘shinyapps’

I believe Shinyapp is not supported by R 3.2.3. Is there any way around it?

-Deb

