You will likely need to re-deploy your application in order to pick up the change.

On Wednesday, March 2, 2016 at 7:33:55 PM UTC-5, Ralph Møller Trane wrote:
> Awesome! Thanks
>
> Den onsdag den 2. marts 2016 kl. 15.03.14 UTC-6 skrev Joshua Spiewak:
